I am back in my flat.
I take off my jacket.
Then I go straight into the kitchen.
I unpack my shopping.
First I wash the vegetables.
I cut the vegetables into small pieces.
After that I cook the pasta.
I make a simple vegetable sauce.
The food smells very good.
I put my plate on the table.
I sit at the table and eat.
The pasta tastes really delicious.
I drink a glass of water with it.
The evening is very quiet.
I enjoy the time.
Later I tidy up the kitchen.
Now I am resting.
